{"id":"b5f77bed7dfe3f07","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md","title":"Stochastic Process","display":"df-stochastic-process — Stochastic Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-stochastic-process","aliases":["58-df-stochastic-process","Stochastic Process"],"display":"df-stochastic-process — Stochastic Process","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-random-variable.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-stochastic-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-stochastic-process</span><span>Stochastic Process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stochastic-process — Stochastic Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"49ad0501f11b0cd1\" href=\"?note=49ad0501f11b0cd1\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-random-variable.md\">../batch06/58-df-random-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E\\in V\">\\(X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"49ad0501f11b0cd1\" href=\"?note=49ad0501f11b0cd1\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-random-variable.md\">../batch06/58-df-random-variable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StochProc}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{StochProc}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stochastic\\text{-}process}\\vdash\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal E,E)\\land X:I\\to E^\\Omega\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S(X(t);(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(E,\\mathcal E))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stochastic\\text{-}process}\\vdash\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal E,E)\\land X:I\\to E^\\Omega\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S(X(t);(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(E,\\mathcal E))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Stochastic process: collection of random variables indexed by time</li>\n<li>A filtration and adaptedness are additional structure, not part of a bare stochastic process.</li>\n<li>Adaptedness is the derived condition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall t\\in I\\;(\\sigma(X_t)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_t)\">\\(\\forall t\\in I\\;(\\sigma(X_t)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_t)\\)</span> after a filtration is supplied.</li>\n<li>Processes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> are modifications when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P(X_t=Y_t)=1\">\\(\\mathbb P(X_t=Y_t)=1\\)</span> for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in I\">\\(t\\in I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Filtration enlargement: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}_t^{X}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}_t^{X}\\)</span> natural filtration</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Karatzas and Shreve, Brownian Motion and Stochastic Calculus</li>\n<li>Protter, Stochastic Integration and Differential Equations</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-random-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"49ad0501f11b0cd1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-random-variable.md]]","embed":false